    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31257" root="عيل" body-key="E">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عيّل</span></b>  as intrans.: see 4; and see also 1 in
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عول</span>, fourth sentence. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عيّل عيَالَهُ</span> <i>He
neglected his family,</i> or <i>household:</i> (TA, and K
in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عول</span>:) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعْيِيلٌ</span> signifies the <i>feeding badly.</i>
(S, O.) See also 2 in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عول</span>, second sentence.
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And see 1 in that art., first sentence. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عيّل</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَرَسَهُ</span> <i>He</i> (a man) <i>left his horse alone,</i> or <i>by himself, to pasture where he would, without a pastor,
in the desert.</i> (S, O.)

